OL,3,GNEWSARescuers find 100 guinea pigs in
OL,4,Aone home
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal charity has rescued more than
OL,7,F100 newborn and adult guinea pigs from
OL,8,Fa home.
OL,10,FThe RSPCA said the number of guinea
OL,11,Fpigs "rapidly grew out of control,
OL,12,Fleaving an owner unable to cope".
OL,14,FAbout 70 of the animals are being cared
OL,15,Ffor at the charity's Cambridge branch,
OL,16,F21 in Milton Keynes, and 10 at the
OL,17,FSouth Buckinghamshire branch, with more
OL,18,Fsent to other centres. Some have also
OL,19,Fbeen allowed to stay with the owner.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
