OL,3,GNEWSARescuers find 100 guinea pigs in
OL,4,Aone home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RSPCA has put out a "desperate"
OL,7,Fplea for foster carers as it expected
OL,8,Fthe numbers to increase, as many of the
OL,9,Frescued females were pregnant.
